{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>**This game features immersive spatial audio as a key gameplay mechanic. Headphones are STRONGLY recommended for the best experience.**</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Peek&quot; is a psychological horror puzzle game that relies primarily on spatial audio and directional awareness\u00a0in order to gather the clues necessary to\u00a0complete a ritual to free the room of an unwanted presence...without making too many mistakes in the process, hopefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're performing a ritual on a <strong>5x5 grid</strong>, trying to cleanse a room haunted by a restless spirit. But the only way to uncover the correct placements is to <strong>close your eyes</strong>\u00a0and <strong>listen</strong>. As you kneel, whispering your prayer, the spirit moves around you, dropping subtle hints and feeding you breadcrumbs of information as how to best prepare the ritual itself.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the spirit's movements closely, and place the ritual items with precision. Hold your breath as the spirit returns to validate your previous placements. Let's hope that your senses are sharpened, because an incorrect setup is sure to anger the dead...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And most importantly, whatever you do...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DON'T PEEK!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575190/extras/peek_items_1.gif?t=1741310311\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575190/extras/Movie_030.gif?t=1741310311\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3575190?t=1741310311","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3575190?t=17413103